OL,3,GNEWSAAnswers needed on transgender
OL,4,Asurgery pause, says health minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FA meeting to discuss the decision to
OL,7,Fimmediately pause referrals for
OL,8,Fgender-affirming surgeries in Wales has
OL,9,Fbeen called by the health minister.
OL,11,FThe Welsh Gender Service paused surgery
OL,12,Flast week after concerns from an NHS
OL,13,Fcommittee about the number of referrals
OL,14,Fand whether they were all appropriate.
OL,16,FWales' health minister, Mabon ap
OL,17,FGwynfor, is meeting with members of the
OL,18,FNHS Wales Joint Commissioning Committee
OL,19,F(NWJCC), which instructed Cardiff and
OL,20,FVale University Health Board to halt
OL,21,Fboth new referrals and planned
OL,22,Fsurgeries, on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
